        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iby'inkoni ebyiri zitwa Buntu na Kunga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kingura inzugi zawe Lebanoni, umuriro utwike imyerezi yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boroga wa muberoshi we, kuko umwerezi uguye kandi ibiti byiza cyane bikaba byangiritse. Nimuboroge mwa myela y'i Bashani mwe, kuko ishyamba ritamenwa riguye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umva ijwi ry'induru y'abashumba kuko icyubahiro cyabo cyangiritse, umva ijwi ry'imigunzu y'intare yivuga kuko ubwibone bwa Yorodani bwangiritse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka Imana yanjye iravuga iti “Ragira ubushyo bw'imbagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bene zo ni bo bazica bakibwira ko nta bicumuro bafite, kandi abazitunda bakavuga bati ‘Uwiteka ashimwe kuko mbaye umukire’, kandi abashumba bazo ntibazibabariye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sinzongera kubabarira abaturage bo mu gihugu, ni ko Uwiteka avuga, ahubwo nzabatanga, umuntu wese mugabize mugenzi we cyangwa umwami. Abo bazagirira igihugu nabi kandi sinzababakiza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ndagira ubushyo bw'imbagwa, ni koko zari mbi. Maze nenda inkoni ebyiri imwe nyita Buntu, indi nyita Kunga mperako ndagira ubushyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kwezi kumwe nirukana abo bashumba batatu kuko bari banduhije, kandi na bo bari banzinutswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ndavuga nti “Sinzabaragira, upfuye napfe, uzakurwaho nakurweho, abazarokoka bazaryane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze nenda inkoni yanjye Buntu nyicamo kabiri, kugira ngo nice isezerano nasezeranye n'amahanga yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo munsi iravunika, maze abakene bo mu bushyo banyumviraga bamenya yuko iryo jambo ari iry'Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 26.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ndababwira nti “Niba mureba ko ari byiza nimumpe ibihembo byanjye, kandi niba atari byiza nimurorere.” Nuko bangerera ibice by'ifeza mirongo itatu, babimpa ho ibihembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.27.9+MAT.27.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 27.9-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka arambwira ati “Jugunyira umubumbyi ya ngirwagiciro banciriye.” Nuko nenda bya bice by'ifeza mirongo itatu, ndabijyana mbijugunyira umubumbyi mu nzu y'Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze inkoni yanjye ya kabiri yitwa Kunga nyicamo kabiri, kugira ngo nice ubuvandimwe bwa Yuda na Isirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Uwiteka arambwira ati “Ongera urarure ibintu by'umushumba gito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dore nzahagurutsa umushumba mu gihugu utazita ku ntama zizimiye, kandi ntazashaka izatatanye, izivunitse ntazazunga n'inzima ntazaziragira, ahubwo azarya inyama z'izibyibushye ndetse azaguguna n'inzara zazo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azabona ishyano uwo mwungeri gito usiga umukumbi! Inkota izamukubita ku kuboko no ku jisho ry'iburyo, ukuboko kwe kuzuma pe, kandi ijisho rye ry'iburyo rizahuma rwose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
